&nbsp;

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:12.320
And there are, of course,&nbsp;
five kingdoms in Kumandra.
&nbsp;

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:16.160
And at the end of the story, one&nbsp;
person from each of the five kingdoms&nbsp;&nbsp;

